# The test fixtures are byte-exact documents: a line-ending translation would
# rewrite a PDF's xref offsets and break every fixture test on Windows. The
# `binary` attribute is git's shorthand for `-text -diff` — no conversion, and
# a diff that says "Binary files differ" rather than pretending to read them.
*.pdf binary

# Snapshot roots are generated from these at the same byte level.
*.png binary
